{
  "id": "ecb-e2e-signup-payment",
  "version": "2.0",
  "name": "EcoBuilding — inscription & paiement",
  "url": "${APP_URL}",
  "tests": [
    {
      "id": "t01-inscription",
      "name": "01 · inscription (formulaire Keycloak réel)",
      "commands": [
        {
          "id": "c0100",
          "comment": "Le parcours part de l'app, jamais d'une URL Keycloak construite à la main : le client impose PKCE, donc une URL sans code_challenge_method est rejetée. Cliquer le bouton est le seul chemin qu'un vrai utilisateur emprunte.",
          "command": "open",
          "target": "/",
          "targets": [],
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "c0101",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "setWindowSize",
          "target": "1400x1000",
          "targets": [],
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "c0102",
          "comment": "#215 : ce bouton doit apparaître même si l'adaptateur Keycloak ne se charge pas. S'il manque, le produit n'a plus d'inscription du tout.",
          "command": "waitForElementVisible",
          "target": "id=signup",
          "targets": [
            [
              "id=signup",
              "id"
            ],
            [
              "css=#signup",
              "css:finder"
            ]
          ],
          "value": "20000"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0103",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "click",
          "target": "id=signup",
          "targets": [
            [
              "id=signup",
              "id"
            ]
          ],
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "c0104",
          "comment": "Formulaire d'inscription Keycloak (realm ${KC_REALM}).",
          "command": "waitForElementVisible",
          "target": "id=email",
          "targets": [
            [
              "id=email",
              "id"
            ],
            [
              "name=email",
              "name"
            ]
          ],
          "value": "30000"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0105",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "type",
          "target": "id=email",
          "targets": [
            [
              "id=email",
              "id"
            ]
          ],
          "value": "${E2E_EMAIL}"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0106",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "type",
          "target": "id=password",
          "targets": [
            [
              "id=password",
              "id"
            ]
          ],
          "value": "${E2E_PASSWORD}"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0107",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "type",
          "target": "id=password-confirm",
          "targets": [
            [
              "id=password-confirm",
              "id"
            ]
          ],
          "value": "${E2E_PASSWORD}"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0108",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "type",
          "target": "id=firstName",
          "targets": [
            [
              "id=firstName",
              "id"
            ]
          ],
          "value": "${E2E_FIRSTNAME}"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0109",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "type",
          "target": "id=lastName",
          "targets": [
            [
              "id=lastName",
              "id"
            ]
          ],
          "value": "${E2E_LASTNAME}"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0110",
          "comment": "Organisation est OBLIGATOIRE (user profile déclaratif). L'omettre produit « Account is not fully set up » à la connexion suivante, pas une erreur sur ce formulaire — d'où le test explicite 06.",
          "command": "type",
          "target": "id=organization",
          "targets": [
            [
              "id=organization",
              "id"
            ]
          ],
          "value": "${E2E_ORG}"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0111",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "click",
          "target": "css=input[type=\"submit\"]",
          "targets": [
            [
              "css=input[type=\"submit\"]",
              "css:finder"
            ]
          ],
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "c0112",
          "comment": "Le formulaire a disparu : Keycloak a accepté l'inscription. Assertion STRUCTURELLE, pas textuelle — le thème s'affiche dans la langue du navigateur, et un test qui dépend d'une traduction casse au premier changement de locale.",
          "command": "waitForElementNotPresent",
          "target": "id=organization",
          "targets": [],
          "value": "30000"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0113",
          "comment": "Et on n'est pas retombé sur le formulaire avec une erreur de champ.",
          "command": "assertElementNotPresent",
          "target": "css=#input-error-organization",
          "targets": [],
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "c0114",
          "comment": "L'existence réelle du compte (et le fait que la vérification e-mail soit bien EXIGÉE) est vérifiée côté serveur par run.sh, qui interroge Keycloak.",
          "command": "echo",
          "target": "inscription soumise pour ${E2E_EMAIL}",
          "targets": [],
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "t06-org-obligatoire",
      "name": "06 · l'organisation manquante est refusée sur le formulaire",
      "commands": [
        {
          "id": "c0600",
          "comment": "Régression connue : sans organisation, Keycloak laissait passer l'inscription puis bloquait la connexion par « Account is not fully set up » — un mur sans issue pour l'utilisateur. Le refus doit avoir lieu SUR le formulaire.",
          "command": "open",
          "target": "/",
          "targets": [],
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "c0600b",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "setWindowSize",
          "target": "1400x1000",
          "targets": [],
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "c0601",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "waitForElementVisible",
          "target": "id=signup",
          "targets": [
            [
              "id=signup",
              "id"
            ]
          ],
          "value": "20000"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0602",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "click",
          "target": "id=signup",
          "targets": [
            [
              "id=signup",
              "id"
            ]
          ],
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "c0603",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "waitForElementVisible",
          "target": "id=email",
          "targets": [
            [
              "id=email",
              "id"
            ]
          ],
          "value": "30000"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0604",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "type",
          "target": "id=email",
          "targets": [
            [
              "id=email",
              "id"
            ]
          ],
          "value": "${E2E_EMAIL_NOORG}"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0605",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "type",
          "target": "id=password",
          "targets": [
            [
              "id=password",
              "id"
            ]
          ],
          "value": "${E2E_PASSWORD}"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0606",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "type",
          "target": "id=password-confirm",
          "targets": [
            [
              "id=password-confirm",
              "id"
            ]
          ],
          "value": "${E2E_PASSWORD}"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0607",
          "comment": "Organisation laissée vide, volontairement.",
          "command": "click",
          "target": "css=input[type=\"submit\"]",
          "targets": [],
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "c0608",
          "comment": "Laisser l'aller-retour POST se faire avant de conclure.",
          "command": "pause",
          "target": "",
          "targets": [],
          "value": "4000"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0609",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "assertElementPresent",
          "target": "id=organization",
          "targets": [
            [
              "id=organization",
              "id"
            ]
          ],
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "c0610",
          "comment": "Toujours sur le formulaire = refusé au bon endroit. S'il avait été accepté, on serait sur l'écran de vérification d'e-mail.",
          "command": "assertElementPresent",
          "target": "id=organization",
          "targets": [],
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "c0611",
          "comment": "Et l'erreur est portée par le CHAMP, pas par un message global illisible.",
          "command": "assertElementPresent",
          "target": "css=#input-error-organization",
          "targets": [],
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "t02-04-parcours",
      "name": "02-04 · parcours payant : connexion → fiche → ouverture du checkout",
      "commands": [
        {
          "id": "cm000",
          "comment": "Un seul test Selenium pour tout le parcours payant. Ce n'est pas un choix de style : selenium-side-runner 4.0.13 termine chaque test par driver.close() même en persistSession, et fermer la DERNIÈRE fenêtre de Chromium tue la session — un découpage en 4 tests perd donc la connexion entre deux tests. Le parcours est de toute façon UNE session utilisateur continue.",
          "command": "echo",
          "target": "début du parcours payant",
          "targets": [],
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "c0200",
          "comment": "L'adresse a été vérifiée entre les deux suites (voir run.sh) : la boîte de réception est un vrai mailbox externe, non lisible depuis la CI.",
          "command": "open",
          "target": "/",
          "targets": [],
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "c0201",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "waitForElementVisible",
          "target": "id=signin",
          "targets": [
            [
              "id=signin",
              "id"
            ]
          ],
          "value": "20000"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0202",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "click",
          "target": "id=signin",
          "targets": [
            [
              "id=signin",
              "id"
            ]
          ],
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "c0203",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "waitForElementVisible",
          "target": "id=username",
          "targets": [
            [
              "id=username",
              "id"
            ]
          ],
          "value": "30000"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0204",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "type",
          "target": "id=username",
          "targets": [
            [
              "id=username",
              "id"
            ]
          ],
          "value": "${E2E_EMAIL}"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0205",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "type",
          "target": "id=password",
          "targets": [
            [
              "id=password",
              "id"
            ]
          ],
          "value": "${E2E_PASSWORD}"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0206",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "click",
          "target": "id=kc-login",
          "targets": [
            [
              "id=kc-login",
              "id"
            ],
            [
              "css=#kc-login",
              "css:finder"
            ]
          ],
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "c0207",
          "comment": "Retour sur l'app connecté : la pastille compte remplace les boutons.",
          "command": "waitForElementVisible",
          "target": "id=userchip",
          "targets": [
            [
              "id=userchip",
              "id"
            ]
          ],
          "value": "40000"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0208",
          "comment": "Le libellé doit porter l'adresse du compte : sinon la session appartient à quelqu'un d'autre.",
          "command": "assertElementPresent",
          "target": "xpath=//span[@id='userlabel'][contains(text(),'${E2E_EMAIL}')]",
          "targets": [],
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "c0209",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "echo",
          "target": "connecté en tant que ${E2E_EMAIL}",
          "targets": [],
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "c0300",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "waitForElementVisible",
          "target": "id=search",
          "targets": [
            [
              "id=search",
              "id"
            ]
          ],
          "value": "20000"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0301",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "click",
          "target": "id=search",
          "targets": [
            [
              "id=search",
              "id"
            ]
          ],
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "c0302",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "type",
          "target": "id=search",
          "targets": [
            [
              "id=search",
              "id"
            ]
          ],
          "value": "${E2E_ADDRESS}"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0303",
          "comment": "Autocomplétion BAN.",
          "command": "waitForElementVisible",
          "target": "css=#suggestions li",
          "targets": [
            [
              "css=#suggestions li",
              "css:finder"
            ]
          ],
          "value": "30000"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0304",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "click",
          "target": "css=#suggestions li:first-child",
          "targets": [
            [
              "css=#suggestions li:first-child",
              "css:finder"
            ]
          ],
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "c0305",
          "comment": "Le panneau agrège une dizaine de sources ouvertes : il peut être lent, d'où l'attente longue.",
          "command": "waitForElementVisible",
          "target": "id=report-btn",
          "targets": [
            [
              "id=report-btn",
              "id"
            ]
          ],
          "value": "150000"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0306",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "click",
          "target": "id=report-btn",
          "targets": [
            [
              "id=report-btn",
              "id"
            ]
          ],
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "c0307",
          "comment": "Génération WeasyPrint côté serveur : laisser le décompte s'appliquer avant de relire le quota.",
          "command": "pause",
          "target": "",
          "targets": [],
          "value": "${PDF_WAIT_MS}"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0308",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "echo",
          "target": "fiche demandée pour ${E2E_ADDRESS}",
          "targets": [],
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "c0400",
          "comment": "« Passer Pro » n'existe qu'avec ECO_PRO_ENABLED : masqué en production (rule 7), visible en sandbox.",
          "command": "waitForElementVisible",
          "target": "id=gopro",
          "targets": [
            [
              "id=gopro",
              "id"
            ]
          ],
          "value": "30000"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0401",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "click",
          "target": "id=gopro",
          "targets": [
            [
              "id=gopro",
              "id"
            ]
          ],
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "c0402",
          "comment": "Fin de la partie navigateur-produit : le clic « Passer Pro » ouvre désormais le checkout Creem EMBARQUÉ (overlay iframe sur notre page — demande opérateur : ne pas quitter la plateforme). On attend l'iframe. Sa TRAVERSÉE reste déléguée à e2e/checkout-creem.mjs (session CDP dédiée sur l'URL de checkout) : la page rejette WebDriver, recette validée jusqu'à ?pro=success — même principe que la vérification e-mail par l'API admin.",
          "command": "waitForElementPresent",
          "target": "css=iframe[src*=\"creem.io\"]",
          "targets": [],
          "value": "45000"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "t05-pro",
      "name": "05 · le compte est passé Pro",
      "commands": [
        {
          "id": "c0500",
          "comment": "Nouvelle session navigateur : on se reconnecte.",
          "command": "open",
          "target": "/",
          "targets": [],
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "c0500b",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "setWindowSize",
          "target": "1400x1000",
          "targets": [],
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "c0501",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "waitForElementVisible",
          "target": "id=signin",
          "targets": [],
          "value": "20000"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0502",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "click",
          "target": "id=signin",
          "targets": [],
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "c0503",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "waitForElementVisible",
          "target": "id=username",
          "targets": [],
          "value": "30000"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0504",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "type",
          "target": "id=username",
          "targets": [],
          "value": "${E2E_EMAIL}"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0505",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "type",
          "target": "id=password",
          "targets": [],
          "value": "${E2E_PASSWORD}"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0506",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "click",
          "target": "id=kc-login",
          "targets": [],
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "c0507",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "waitForElementVisible",
          "target": "id=userchip",
          "targets": [],
          "value": "40000"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0508",
          "comment": "Ouvre le panneau compte (plan, quota, clés API).",
          "command": "click",
          "target": "id=userlabel",
          "targets": [],
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "c0509",
          "comment": "",
          "command": "waitForElementVisible",
          "target": "id=panel-content",
          "targets": [],
          "value": "30000"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0510",
          "comment": "Le panneau doit annoncer le plan Pro — la réconciliation par e-mail (_creem_subscription_active) a eu PRO_WAIT pour tourner. L'assertion côté PLATEFORME est faite par payment_report.py.",
          "command": "assertElementPresent",
          "target": "xpath=//*[@id='panel-content'][contains(translate(.,'PRO','pro'),'pro')]",
          "targets": [],
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "suites": [
    {
      "id": "s01-inscription",
      "name": "inscription",
      "persistSession": false,
      "parallel": false,
      "timeout": 600,
      "tests": [
        "t01-inscription",
        "t06-org-obligatoire"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-paiement",
      "name": "paiement",
      "persistSession": false,
      "parallel": false,
      "timeout": 900,
      "tests": [
        "t02-04-parcours"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s03-pro",
      "name": "pro",
      "persistSession": false,
      "parallel": false,
      "timeout": 600,
      "tests": [
        "t05-pro"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "urls": [
    "${APP_URL}"
  ],
  "plugins": []
}